    "summary": "Woman&#039;s wrapper or shawl; composed of eighteen narrow strips hand sewn together. Warp stripes in hand spun cotton: indigo-dyed on white cotton ikat and plain white; single red-dyed cotton stripe at one side. Decorated with supplementary weft float patterns in coloured cotton. Additional white cotton tassels along borders. Decorative twined white cotton threads at both ends. Short twisted warp thread fringes.",
